# The Colossus's enters trigger is already on the stack when Bot2 exiles it with Swords to Plowshares (Bot1 gains 5, its power then). The
# trigger still resolves (it is independent of its source, CR 113.7a): X is counted as it resolves, and the Colossus is no longer one of
# the artifacts, so X = 5 (Mox Ruby, Gleemox, Mox Jet, Mox Sapphire, Sol Ring) and Ragavan is 7/1 with trample until end of turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Gleemox
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Sol Ring
Craterclaw Colossus
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Island x18

